# The ComfyUI image builds almost entirely from remote sources (git clone +
# pip); only the two files below are COPY'd in from the host context. Exclude
# everything else so the 10GB+ of local data (storage/, models/, n8n-data/,
# etc.) stays out of the docker build context.
*
!Dockerfile
!comfyui/entrypoint.sh
!comfyui/patch_comfy_kitchen.py

